title: "pvf-checker: process deactivations when the runtime API is unsupported"
doc:
  - audience: [Node Dev, Node Operator]
    description: |
      Process deactivated leaves even when the newly activated leaf does not support
      the PVF pre-checking runtime API. This removes obsolete PVF judgements instead
      of retaining and resubmitting them in later sessions.

      No API changes or storage migration are required.
crates:
  - name: polkadot-node-core-pvf-checker
    bump: patch
